sourceData.updateRule:
陆安数值变化时更新对应字段。
SQL示例(单字段): UPDATE lu_an_tracking SET trust_level = 10 WHERE row_id = 1;
SQL示例(多数值): UPDATE lu_an_tracking SET zizhi = 8, gongqing = 7, jiegou = 6, trust_level = 9 WHERE row_id = 1;
SQL示例(目标/看法): UPDATE lu_an_tracking SET short_term_goal = '收集药材治疗伤势', view_of_protagonist = '逐渐信任的同伴' WHERE row_id = 1;
